2026-06-09 14:14:28.606 [info] [Terminal] Executing command {"terminalId":11,"command":"python -c \"\nimport time, random\nfrom src.models.engineer import Engineer\nfrom src.models.job import Job\nfrom src.scheduling.scheduler import Scheduler\n\nALL_SKILLS = ['repair', 'install', 'inspect', 'configure', 'maintain',\n    'replace', 'upgrade', 'troubleshoot', 'calibrate', 'test']\n\ndef create_travel_matrix(n, mn=0.1, mx=0.5, seed=42):\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    locs = [f'LOC{i:05d}' for i in range(n)]\n    return {a: {b: round(rng.uniform(mn, mx), 2) if a != b else 0.0 for b in locs} for a in locs}\n\ndef create_engineers(n, nl, wh=8.0, seed=42):\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    return [Engineer(id=i, name=f'E{i}', location=f'LOC{(i*10)%nl:05d}', skills=rng.sample(ALL_SKILLS, rng.randint(2,4)), working_hours=wh) for i in range(1, n+1)]\n\ndef create_jobs(n, nl, lr=(0.5,1.5), sp=(1,2), seed=42):\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    return [Job(id=i, location=f'LOC{i%nl:05d}', time='09:00', required_skills=rng.sample(ALL_SKILLS, rng.randint(*sp)), length=round(rng.uniform(*lr),1)) for i in range(1, n+1)]\n\ntm = create_travel_matrix(30)\nengineers = create_engineers(25, 30)\njobs = create_jobs(250, 30)\n\nscheduler = Scheduler(engineers, jobs, tm)\nt0 = time.time()\na, r, u = scheduler.create_schedule()\nelapsed = time.time() - t0\nprint(f'Test 1 (25eng, 250jobs): {elapsed:.3f}s (limit: 3s)')\nprint(f'Assigned: {sum(len(v) for v in a.values())}, Unassigned: {len(u)}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10000}
